This product includes a counter-delta token ledger in the style of SparkDash,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, from SparkDash version 2.0.0.

The method is: poll each engine's own counters, add the increase since the
previous sample, treat a drop as a counter reset, and do not add the value
the first time a counter is seen.
